[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0014","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0659","title":"OpenSSL ASN.1 Library 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.6d 及更早版本、0.9.7-beta2 及更早版本的 ASN.1 库存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 ASN.1 编码数据触发该漏洞，导致 OpenSSL 服务崩溃。攻击无需认证即可执行，影响使用了上述版本 OpenSSL 的各类服务器和应用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0659"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:53.240","remediation":"升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.6e 及以上版本或 0.9.7-beta3 及以上版本，该漏洞在 ASN.1 解析库中修复了畸形编码导致的拒绝服务问题。如无法升级，可在网络边界限制对 OpenSSL 服务的访问或部署 IPS 防护畸形 SSL 报文。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000516","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-160.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-161.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-164.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-23.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9718.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/748355","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5366","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/23199","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0659.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0659.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0659","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2002/0xxx/cve-2002-0659.yaml%232","https://github.com/secure-software-engineering/achilles-benchmark-depscanners/blob/78b391f47cbe64adf7a2e2182ff94be604eb94dd/detection/CVE-2002-0659__rubygems_jruby-openssl_0.9.7.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0659.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-3x2f-268g-8hg7/GHSA-3x2f-268g-8hg7.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-161.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0659.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0013","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0658","title":"OSSP libmm 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"OSSP mm 共享内存库（libmm）1.2.0 之前版本存在本地权限提升漏洞。由于该库在处理临时文件时未正确检查文件链接，本地 Apache 用户可通过符号链接攻击操纵临时文件，从而获取目标系统上的更高权限。攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，利用条件较低。该漏洞影响 OSSP mm 1.2.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0658"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:53.087","remediation":"升级 OSSP mm library (libmm) 至 1.2.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复临时文件创建中的竞争条件问题。如无法立即升级，确保 Apache 用户对临时文件目录（如 /tmp）的写入权限受到严格限制，并启用文件系统防护机制（如 symlink 保护）以缓解符号链接攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4392","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-153.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-154.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-156.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-164.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-137","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9719.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-045.php","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_028_mod_ssl.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-163.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-158.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5352","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21667","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0658.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0658","https://github.com/greenbone/openvas-scanner/blob/89b5e7c93479ed826ada1f0f549063baf718043a/rust/examples/feed/notus/advisories/windows.notus","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-0658.md","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-0658","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0658.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-8phx-r45c-q556/GHSA-8phx-r45c-q556.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-154.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-045.nasl","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/h/hpux_PHSS_27423.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0012","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0657","title":"OpenSSL 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.7 至 0.9.7-beta3 版本在启用 Kerberos 支持时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当处理过长的 master key 时，程序未正确验证输入长度，导致堆栈缓冲区溢出。远程攻击者可向使用受影响 OpenSSL 版本的服务端发送特制的 Kerberos 握手请求，触发该漏洞，进而执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有启用 Kerberos 选项编译的 OpenSSL 应用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0657"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:52.960","remediation":"升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.7-beta3 或更高版本。如无法升级，可在编译时通过 --disable-kerberos 选项禁用 Kerberos 支持作为临时缓解措施。同时限制仅可信网络来源访问使用 OpenSSL 的服务端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000513","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-23.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9715.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/561275","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-046.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5361","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0657.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0657.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0657","https://github.com/secure-software-engineering/achilles-benchmark-depscanners/blob/78b391f47cbe64adf7a2e2182ff94be604eb94dd/detection/CVE-2002-0657__rubygems_jruby-openssl_0.9.7.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0657.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0657.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-p3wx-7ggv-j5vx/GHSA-p3wx-7ggv-j5vx.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-046.nasl","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/high/OpenSSL%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%E7%AB%AF%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E8%B6%85%E9%95%BFSSL3%E5%AF%86%E9%92%A5%E7%BC%93%E5%86%B2%E5%8C%BA%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2002-0657).html","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/O/openssl_0_9_7_beta3.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0011","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0656","title":"OpenSSL SSL2/SSL3 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.6d 及之前版本、0.9.7-beta2 及之前版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 SSL2 协议发送特制的大尺寸客户端主密钥（client master key），或向 SSL3 协议发送超长会话 ID（session ID），触发缓冲区溢出，进而导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 Apache mod_ssl 等使用 OpenSSL 的应用程序，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0656"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:52.810","remediation":"立即升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.6e 或 0.9.7-beta3 及以上版本，同时升级 Apache mod_ssl 至最新版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Apache 配置中禁用 SSLv2 协议（SSLProtocol all -SSLv2）作为临时缓解措施，并限制仅使用 TLS 协议通信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000513","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-23.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9714.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9716.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/102795","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/258555","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-046.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5362","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5363","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/40347","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0656.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0656.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0656","https://github.com/mudongliang/LinuxFlaw/blob/7738b4e61bddf979fe10215125da19bcb99d2318/README.md","https://github.com/secure-software-engineering/achilles-benchmark-depscanners/blob/78b391f47cbe64adf7a2e2182ff94be604eb94dd/detection/CVE-2002-0656__org.jruby_openssl_0.9.4.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2002/0xxx/cve-2002-0656.yaml%231","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0656.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-9jw8-9j6r-p392/GHSA-9jw8-9j6r-p392.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-157.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0656.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0010","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0655","title":"OpenSSL 64位平台ASCII整数表示处理不当拒绝服务与代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenSSL 0.9.7-beta2 及之前版本、0.9.6d 及之前版本在处理 64 位平台上的整数 ASCII 表示时存在缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向使用受影响 OpenSSL 版本的服务发送特制数据触发此漏洞，导致拒绝服务甚至远程代码执行。该漏洞影响大量依赖 OpenSSL 的应用程序与系统（如 macOS X 及其他 UNIX-like 系统），CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0655"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:52.677","remediation":"将 OpenSSL 升级至 0.9.6e 及以上版本，或 0.9.7-beta3 及以上版本。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新：FreeBSD 升级至 4.6.1-RELEASE-p10，Mandrake Linux 安装 MDKSA-2002-046 更新，Caldera OpenLinux 应用 CSSA-2002-033 补丁。临时缓解措施可在服务器端禁用 SSLv2 协议，客户端暂无有效缓解手段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000513","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-23.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/308891","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-046.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5364","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0655.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0655.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0655","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2002.txt","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2002-0655-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/secure-software-engineering/achilles-benchmark-depscanners/blob/78b391f47cbe64adf7a2e2182ff94be604eb94dd/detection/CVE-2002-0655__org.jruby_openssl_0.9.4.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2002/0xxx/cve-2002-0655.yaml%231","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0655.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0655.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2002-157.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0004","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0391","title":"Sun RPC XDR库xdr_array函数整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"在 SunRPC 及其衍生实现（如 GNU glibc、dietlibc）的 XDR 库 xdr_array() 函数中存在整数溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向运行 RPC 服务的系统（如 rpc.cmsd、dmispd 等服务）发送包含大量参数的特制 RPC 请求，触发整数溢出导致堆破坏，最终实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有基于 SunRPC 代码的操作系统，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0391"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:20.673","remediation":"建议升级 glibc 至 2.2.5 及以上版本（Red Hat Linux 升级至 7.2 对应更新包），或安装各厂商 2002 年发布的 libc 安全补丁。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上屏蔽 RPC 端口（135/TCP、135/UDP）并禁用不必要的 RPC 服务（rpc.cmsd、dmispd、rpc.statd 等）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/aix/2002-q4/0002.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0514.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2002-q3/0077.html","http://bvlive01.iss.net/issEn/delivery/xforce/alertdetail.jsp?oid=20823","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000515","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000535","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102813809232532&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102821785316087&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102821928418261&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102831443208382&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103158632831416&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4402","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/285740","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-166.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-172.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-25.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-142","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-143","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-146","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-149","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-333","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9170.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/192995","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2399.html","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:057","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-167.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-173.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-168.html","http://www.redhat.