双重释放远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tinyproxy HTTP 代理服务器 1.5.0、1.4.3 及更早版本中存在双重释放（double-free）内存漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标代理服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致内存损坏，进而实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响运行 tinyproxy 的各类 Linux/Unix 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0847"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 tinyproxy 至 1.4.4 或更高版本（上游修复版本）。Debian 用户应参考 DSA-145，将 woody 系统上的 tinyproxy 升级至 1.4.3-2woody2，unstable 系统升级至 1.4.3-3。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?release_id=88790","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9079.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4731","https://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-145"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0015","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0661","title":"Apache 2.0 编码反斜杠目录遍历漏洞","description":"Apache 2.0 至 2.0.39 版本在 Windows、OS2 及 Netware 平台上存在编码反斜杠目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含编码反斜杠（%5C）的 .. 目录跳转序列，绕过路径访问限制，实现任意文件读取与命令执行。该漏洞源于 Apache 对编码后的反斜杠字符处理不当，导致路径校验机制被绕过，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响多个操作系统平台上的 Apache 部署。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0661"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-08-12","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"升级 Apache 至 2.0.40 或更高版本，该版本已修复反斜杠编码的目录遍历问题。如无法立即升级，在 httpd.conf 中禁用 AllowOverride 并限制对文件系统的访问路径，同时在反向代理前过滤包含反斜杠的 URL 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://httpd.apache.org/info/security_bulletin_20020908a.txt","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102892744011436&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102951160411052&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9808.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5434","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/54a42d4b01968df1117cea77fc53d6beb931c0e05936ad02af93e9ac%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://list