VE-2002-0651"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:51.960","remediation":"升级 glibc 至 2.2.5 及以上版本（或安装对应发行版安全补丁，如 Red Hat 的 RHSA-2002:132），或升级 BIND 至 8.3.3 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在边界防火墙上限制对 DNS 服务器的递归查询来源，仅允许可信 IP 段发起 DNS 请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/aix/2002-q3/0001.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/engarde/2002-q3/0002.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2002-q3/0000.html","http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000507","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:038","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102513011311504&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102520962320134&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102579743329251&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-139.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-19.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9432.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/803539","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-043.php","http://www.pine.nl/advisories/pine-cert-20020601.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-119.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-133.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-167.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-154.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5100","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A4190","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0651.md","https://github.com/nmap/nmap/blob/817dc4df9ef999a9f1bfe076750ebae15be898d0/scripts/vulners.nse","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0651","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/eec8260c2bd062f13f39559c10bba480b01b3d7a/2002/CVE-2002-0651.json","https://github.com/vulnerability-lookup/vulnerab