s/id/369347","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2177.html","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:040","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_024_openssh_txt.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2024/07/01/3","http://www.osvdb.org/839","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-127.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-131.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5093","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX0206-195","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21579","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0640.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0640.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0640","https://github.com/lal0ne/vulnerability/blob/5b9f397c1970203b1764fb7a66a0ffac39bef4cc/OpenSSH/CVE-2024-6387/regresshion.txt","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/5462df1242ecdfa07cb8ddac80e6ca8fcb2b6836/2002/CVE-2002-0640.md","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/remote-exploits/39674.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-q9hw-p2pq-q4p7/GHSA-q9hw-p2pq-q4p7.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/openssh_afs.nasl","https://github.com/krafthack-by-techday/Night-s-watch/blob/30ae1bcc335306fe4c5507b2c629cae4932e515e/cve/nvd/CVE-2002-0640_5ed1f677-6985-43fb-a11c-0a18409b428c","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0640.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0006","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0639","title":"OpenBSD OpenSSH 整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 的 sshd 组件在挑战响应认证（ChallengeResponseAuthentication）过程中存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190），当使用 SKEY 或 BSD_AUTH 认证方式时，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过特制的认证请求触发整数溢出，导致缓冲区溢出，最终实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 OpenSSH 2.9.9 至 3.3 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0639"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-07-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:50.390","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 3.4 或更高版本以修复整数溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，在 sshd_config 中启用 UsePrivilegeSeparation yes 并禁用 ChallengeResponseAuthentication 与 SKEY/BSD_AUTH 认证方式作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-06/0335.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000502","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102514371522793&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102514631524575&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102521542826833&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-18.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-134","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9169.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/369347","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-2177.html","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:040","http://www.osvdb.org/6245","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5093","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX0206-195","https://twitter.com/RooneyMcNibNug/status/1152332585349111810","https://web.archive.org/web/20080622172542/www.iss.net/threats/advise123.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2002/CVE-2002-0639.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0639.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cac